    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Expressing emotions",
     "texto": [
      "**mutlu** = happy; **üzgün** = sad; **şaşkın** = surprised.",
      "To ask gently, you can say **Neyin var?** («What's the matter?»). **Bence** means «in my opinion» and **çünkü** means «because»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
